    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77237" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάνᾱμος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰ], ὁ</span>, name of a month, at Argos, <i><span class="en">
